  "releaseNotes": "* Updated to .NET 10 MAUI SR71                        \n                        * Normalize Arabic weekday headers before abbreviation/truncation by @yurkinh with @Copilot in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/250\n                        * Fix #135: boundary day incorrectly disabled when MinimumDate/MaximumDate has a non-midnight time by @yurkinh in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/251\n                        * fix: update package references and font handling for Maui by @yurkinh in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/256\n                        * Fix #227: use AbbreviatedDayNames when truncating weekday headers by @yurkinh with @Copilot in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/252\n                        * Analyzing open issues for easy fixes by @yurkinh with @Copilot in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/254\n                        * Added weekend day background color property by @MykhailoDav in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/258\n                        * Expose visible date range via `ShownDates` API on Calendar by @yurkinh with @Copilot in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/253\n                        * fix: stop Calendar emitting List→ObservableCollection binding warning by @MykhailoDav in https://github.com/yurkinh/Plugin.Maui.Calendar/pull/260",
